---
description: Plan release of the resources the chosen canary acquires.
args:
  surface: AgenticCanarySurface
  probe: AgenticCanaryProbe
returns: string[]
---
List release steps for the exact resources implied by the probe. Close the temporary panel and attached page when used. Unsubscribe and retire a fresh agent and release the channel and diagnostic resources it acquired. Preserve the parent agent and existing channels. Join release before reporting completion.
